  "description": "A contact ticket (WIRE-CONTRACT-V5 §15.7, §15.10). The ticket request takes the optional body {room:\"c\", rid}: rid is the 22-character room id both linked devices derive from their contact secret. The answer is the account ticket's with \"room\":\"c\" echoed; a client that gets no room echo (an older Worker) treats the contact relay as unsupported. The ticket opens only that contact room. A body that is not exactly those two members, or a rid that is not canonical, is 400 bad_request.",
